{"event_type": "POLICY_DECISION", "actor": "COST_GOVERNOR", "payload": {"action": "SETTLEMENT_HOLD: obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001 frozen pending manual reconciliation - the conflicting cross-rail leg is held and the original capture is not disturbed. Rs 5,000.00 of exposure released and frozen against obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001.", "invariant_code": "RECON_01_SETTLEMENT_CONFLICT", "policy": "STANDARD", "rationale": "Rail CARD_TOKEN and rail UPI_CIRCLE each independently processed a locally valid settlement instruction for obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001. Neither rail can see the other's ledger, so neither one alone can detect the conflict - only a canonical view across both settlement legs can. Every authority-dimension invariant was satisfied at authorization time for both legs; this is a post-authorization lifecycle failure, not a delegated-authority violation."}, "experiment_id": "ARENA-20260826-134133", "round_id": 16, "step": 0, "arrow_label": "RECONCILING WITHOUT FREEZING THE WHOLE OBLIGATION", "source": "cost_governor", "target": "outcome", "severity": "success", "event_id": "evt_a73bb068f91c", "sequence": 1225, "timestamp": "2026-08-26T13:41:34.370208+00:00", "monotonic_ms": 14846411.874, "offset_ms": 374.517, "prev_hash": "09f5658940b9f00099e73d4dbfd9f233470c62a18b5919a803e795726388fd64", "entry_hash": "84c010d928001c3cdecfe4f33de8c0a02593b796e8198bde4b16cf921bfde97c"}
